error: alias name not supported
  --> reject/def/alias-name-with-hash.nu:1:7
  |
1 | alias "x#y" = ls
  |       ^^^^^
  = help: a name may not contain `#`, `^` or `%`, start with a word that reads as a value (a number, filesize, duration, date, binary or range), or use whitespace other than single spaces between words
